Sunny is a full port (translation) of Vicinae from C++23/Qt to Rust,
with a Tauri v2 (WebView2) front-end replacing the Qt/QML layer.
Sunny is therefore licensed under GPL-3.0 as a derivative work.

Vicinae upstream includes contributions from its sponsors and community.
This project is not affiliated with, nor endorsed by,
Raycast Technologies Inc. or the Vicinae project.

Out-of-the-box features of the upstream project Sunny ports from:
app search, clipboard history, text expander (snippets), file search,
emoji picker, calculator, window switcher, and extension support
compatible with the Raycast extension ecosystem.
